{
  "work_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_errs",
  "source_path": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_errs.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_errs#CopScr.shenoute-errs.000.0009",
      "source_sha256": "949e60bd40c74cf9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "This, indeed, is given into the hand of the one who will slaughter."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_errs#CopScr.shenoute-errs.000.0023",
      "source_sha256": "45209871ebcbc30b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "It is not drawn out of its sheath by someone else. It draws itself out of its sheath and returns itself to its sheath."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_errs#CopScr.shenoute-errs.000.0024",
      "source_sha256": "33b184eb8997eaaf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "It did not come out of its sheath to slaughter except at the culmination of its anger, as the Lord said about it: “It is sharpened for destruction.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_errs#CopScr.shenoute-errs.000.0025",
      "source_sha256": "aec6e2c4817b956a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "Or: “I have drawn my sword out of its sheath, and it will not return to it from now on.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_errs#CopScr.shenoute-errs.000.0026",
      "source_sha256": "57aada7908598339",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "Or: “They have been handed over to the sword to slaughter them at every gate.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_errs#CopScr.shenoute-errs.000.0027",
      "source_sha256": "949e660ccbeeb231",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "It has been properly prepared to slaughter; it has been properly made to flash like lightning."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_errs#CopScr.shenoute-errs.000.0038",
      "source_sha256": "77a0ec0be4bd5b38",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "Strength is what is in its handle."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_errs#CopScr.shenoute-errs.000.0039",
      "source_sha256": "ce8017373662e688",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "Firmness is what is in its blade."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_errs#CopScr.shenoute-errs.000.0040",
      "source_sha256": "2c3af7e9aeec466e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "Patience, mercy, kindness, generosity, and hope for every good thing are what is in its preparation, or its entire arrangement."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_errs#CopScr.shenoute-errs.000.0041",
      "source_sha256": "4eceb7ebac6462a3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "But it is also stripped of these."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_errs#CopScr.shenoute-errs.000.0042",
      "source_sha256": "55a4cf79a40dbe72",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "And these are what its sheath consists of, together with all the other things of this kind."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_errs#CopScr.shenoute-errs.000.0056",
      "source_sha256": "35f4f9f49c861f93",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "It also terrifies those whom the enemy has weakened with his arrows."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_errs#CopScr.shenoute-errs.000.0060",
      "source_sha256": "7e4c804bf96bb69b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "Its sharpness comes from within it. It is not sharpened by others, as every other sword is sharpened. Rather, its sharpness comes from within it; it is in the person who seeks it."
    }
  ]
}
